      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trenton%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A coal mine opened in 1865, reached full capacity by 1868, and employed 300 of the town's 500 workers.",
